WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.013
Ratio scales have equal differences and a meaningful
zero Zero visits

00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:13.260
means no visits occurred Zero elapsed seconds means
no time elapsed Because

00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:19.370
the zero point represents absence ratio statements
can be meaningful Four

00:00:19.397 --> 00:00:25.100
visits can be twice two visits Ratio variables
support a wide range

00:00:25.127 --> 00:00:30.574
of arithmetic although distribution units and
context still affect which summaries are useful
